## The room the player is standing in

[«id-1»] **The Cavern** (NEVER ENCOUNTERED)
base: A cavern of the drowned mint, its walls pale limestone crusted with mineral scale. Water lies ankle-deep across the floor, still and cold. Nothing has disturbed it in a long time.

### As drawn on the map
a small chamber, about 10 by 35 feet -- long and narrow, running north-south, close to a rectangle, give or take a corner. Ways out: one off the north wall, one off the east wall
The compass here is the MAP's, not the party's: north is north wherever they are facing. Say "the north wall"; never "on your left", which you have no way to know.

### In it
- [«id-2»] The rubble — RoomFeature · near the way in (NEVER ENCOUNTERED)
    base: The rubble of the drowned mint, scaled with mineral crust.
- [«id-3»] The pillars — RoomFeature · spread through the room (NEVER ENCOUNTERED)
    base: The pillars of the drowned mint, scaled with mineral crust.

### Ways out
- [«id-4»] "The mint's stair — out of the dungeon" — A broad flight of worn limestone steps rising out of the water toward the surface. · in the east wall, toward the south end · LEADS OUT OF THE DUNGEON — the way they came in, and the way home. Walking through it ENDS THE RUN: commit nextStage "departed"
- [«id-5»] "A low arch" — a low arch of fitted stone, its keystone dropped an inch · in the north wall, at the middle · leads to [«id-6»], somewhere they have not been

### Every other creature in this dungeon

Not in the room with the player. Yours to change — their \`state\`, their
\`activity\`, where they are heading — and NOT to describe or narrate: the
player is not there to see any of it.

- [«id-7»] A drowned clerk — in [«id-8»] "The Gate house" · 3 rooms away · THE PLAYER HAS NOT BEEN HERE
  doing: Loot
- [«id-9»] A drowned clerk — in [«id-8»] "The Gate house" · 3 rooms away · THE PLAYER HAS NOT BEEN HERE
  doing: Loot
- [«id-10»] A drowned clerk — in [«id-8»] "The Gate house" · 3 rooms away · THE PLAYER HAS NOT BEEN HERE
  doing: Loot
- [«id-11»] The drowned hands — in [«id-6»] "The Chasm" · 1 room away · THE PLAYER HAS NOT BEEN HERE
  doing: Collect

## What this dungeon still has to give

Any ONE of these may be handed over this turn, through \`draw\`, IF the
player has earned it: found in the rubble they were digging through, given
by the thing they talked down, carried by the thing they killed. Something
